    /* RESTAURANTS SECTOR */
    rest_breadcrumb:"Restaurants",
    rest_tag:"Restaurant Sector",
    rest_h1:"AI Automation for Restaurants",
    rest_sub:"AI-powered automation built for the unique demands of restaurants and F&B businesses — from inventory management and reservation handling to customer support and back-office workflows.",
    rest_cta2:"See Case Study",
    rest_s1_h2:"The AI Automation Opportunity for Restaurants",
    rest_s1_p1:"Running a restaurant involves an extraordinary volume of repetitive operational tasks — checking stock levels, responding to reservation requests, answering customer queries, ordering from suppliers, managing reviews, scheduling staff, and generating financial reports. Most of this work follows predictable patterns that AI handles perfectly.",
    rest_s1_p2:"DMC IA builds AI automation systems specifically designed for restaurant operations. We understand the real-time pressure, the seasonal variability, the supplier relationships, and the customer experience demands of the food and beverage industry. Our AI systems take over the operational burden so your team can focus on delivering exceptional food and hospitality.",
    rest_s2_h2:"Restaurant Operations We Automate",
    rest_b1t:"Inventory & Supplier Orders", rest_b1p:"AI tracks ingredient levels, predicts usage based on reservations and historical data, and automatically orders from suppliers before you run out.",
    rest_b2t:"Reservation Management", rest_b2p:"24/7 AI agent handles booking requests, confirmations, reminders, cancellations, and waitlist management across all channels.",
    rest_b3t:"Customer Communications", rest_b3p:"Automated responses to enquiries, booking confirmations, special occasion follow-ups, and loyalty programme management.",
    rest_b4t:"Review Management", rest_b4p:"AI monitors Google, TripAdvisor, and social platforms — drafting personalised, on-brand responses to every review automatically.",
    rest_b5t:"Staff Scheduling", rest_b5p:"AI builds optimal staff schedules based on reservation volume, historical covers, and availability — minimising labour cost while ensuring coverage.",
    rest_b6t:"Financial Reporting", rest_b6p:"Daily revenue summaries, cost of goods analysis, and weekly performance reports generated and delivered automatically.",
    rest_faq1q:"How can AI help restaurants?", rest_faq1a:"AI helps restaurants automate reservation management, inventory ordering, customer communications, review responses, staff scheduling, and financial reporting — reducing manual work and operational costs.",
    rest_faq2q:"Can AI manage restaurant inventory automatically?", rest_faq2a:"Yes. AI analyses consumption patterns, tracks ingredient levels, and automatically generates supplier orders before stock runs out — reducing food waste and stockouts.",
    rest_faq3q:"Can AI handle restaurant reservations?", rest_faq3a:"Yes. AI agents manage online and phone reservation requests, confirm bookings, send reminders, handle cancellations, and manage waitlists 24/7.",
    rest_faq4q:"Can AI respond to restaurant reviews automatically?", rest_faq4a:"Yes. AI monitors review platforms, drafts personalised responses in your brand voice, and responds automatically — saving hours of manual work each week.",
    rest_faq5q:"Is AI automation affordable for a small restaurant?", rest_faq5a:"Yes. DMC IA designs AI automation scaled for small and medium restaurants. ROI is typically achieved within 3–4 months through labour savings and reduced waste.",
    rest_faq6q:"How quickly can a restaurant deploy AI automation?", rest_faq6a:"Most restaurant AI projects are live within 2–4 weeks. Simple automations like reservation management can be deployed in under a week.",
    rest_rel1:"AI Stock Management", rest_rel2:"AI Customer Support", rest_rel3:"Administrative Automation", rest_rel4:"Brunch Café AI Marketing", rest_rel5:"Small Business",
    rest_cta_h2:"Automate your restaurant operations with AI.",
    rest_cta_p:"Get a free audit and discover how much operational time AI can reclaim for your restaurant team.",

    /* ECOMMERCE SECTOR */
    ecom_breadcrumb:"AI Automation for Ecommerce",
    ecom_tag:"Ecommerce Sector",
    ecom_h1:"AI Automation for Ecommerce",
    ecom_sub:"Intelligent AI automation built for online retail — handling orders, inventory, customer support, and marketing campaigns so your ecommerce operation scales without scaling headcount.",
    ecom_s1_p:"Ecommerce businesses face an operational paradox: growth creates more orders, more support queries, more inventory complexity, and more marketing demands — all of which require more staff unless you automate. AI solves this scaling problem permanently. DMC IA builds AI automation systems that handle the full ecommerce operations stack — from the moment an order is placed to post-delivery follow-up — with zero manual intervention.",
    ecom_b1t:"Order Processing Automation", ecom_b1p:"Automatic order confirmation, fulfilment routing, tracking updates, and delivery notifications — processed instantly at any volume.",
    ecom_b2t:"AI Customer Support", ecom_b2p:"24/7 AI agents handle order queries, returns, refunds, product questions, and complaints across email, chat, and social media.",
    ecom_b3t:"Inventory Management", ecom_b3p:"Predictive stock management that anticipates demand, automates reordering, and prevents stockouts across all SKUs.",
    ecom_b4t:"Marketing Automation", ecom_b4p:"Personalised email campaigns, abandoned cart recovery, product recommendations, and review request sequences — fully automated.",
    ecom_b5t:"Returns & Refunds", ecom_b5p:"AI processes return requests, validates eligibility, issues refunds, and updates inventory — with minimal human intervention.",
    ecom_b6t:"Marketplace Management", ecom_b6p:"Automated listing updates, price adjustments, and performance monitoring across multiple sales channels simultaneously.",

