    med_tag:"Healthcare Sector",
    med_h1:"AI Automation for Medical Offices",
    med_sub:"AI-powered automation for healthcare practices — streamlining appointment management, patient communications, administrative workflows, and compliance documentation.",
    med_s1_p:"Medical offices carry an enormous administrative burden that takes time away from patient care. Appointment booking, reminder calls, insurance documentation, referral management, follow-up communications, and reporting — all essential, all repetitive, all perfect candidates for AI automation. DMC IA builds HIPAA-aware AI automation systems designed for the security and compliance requirements of healthcare, delivering operational efficiency without compromising patient data protection.",
    med_b1t:"Appointment Management", med_b1p:"AI handles booking requests, confirmations, reminders, cancellations, and rescheduling 24/7 — reducing no-shows significantly.",
    med_b2t:"Patient Communications", med_b2p:"Automated appointment reminders, prescription renewal notifications, follow-up messages, and health information delivery.",
    med_b3t:"Administrative Workflows", med_b3p:"Insurance pre-authorisations, referral processing, medical record requests, and documentation workflows handled by AI.",
