    re_tag:"Industry Sector",
    re_h1:"AI Automation for Real Estate",
    re_sub:"AI-powered automation for real estate agencies — qualifying leads, coordinating viewings, managing listings, and handling client communications automatically.",
    re_s1_p:"Real estate operations are high-volume and highly repetitive: responding to enquiries, qualifying leads, scheduling viewings, following up with prospects, updating listings, and generating reports. The best agents spend too much time on administration and not enough on closing deals. AI automation changes that entirely. DMC IA builds AI systems that handle every repetitive task in the real estate workflow — so agents focus exclusively on building relationships and closing.",
