    start_h1:"AI Automation for Startups",
    start_sub:"Build enterprise-grade operations from day one. AI automation gives startups the operational capacity of a large team — without the headcount, cost, or management overhead.",
    start_s1_p:"Startups face a fundamental tension: the need to operate lean while building scalable systems. Every founder and early employee who spends time on repetitive operational tasks is not working on product, customers, or growth. AI automation resolves this tension — giving startups the operational infrastructure of a mature company from the very beginning. DMC IA builds startup AI automation systems that scale with your growth, adapt to your evolving workflows, and deliver immediate ROI from the first week of operation.",
    start_b1t:"Operations from Day One", start_b1p:"Deploy AI automation at launch — no legacy processes to migrate, no habits to break. Build the right operational foundation immediately.",
    start_b2t:"Customer Support at Scale", start_b2p:"AI support agents handle customer queries from your first 10 users to your first 10,000 — without adding headcount.",
