    smb_tag:"Industry Sector",
    smb_h1:"AI Automation for Small Business",
    smb_sub:"AI automation built specifically for small businesses — practical, affordable, and designed to eliminate the repetitive tasks that consume your team's time every day.",
    smb_s1_p:"Small businesses are under constant pressure to do more with less. Every hour spent on administration, customer follow-up, data entry, or manual reporting is an hour not spent on growth, customers, or the work that actually makes money. AI automation changes the economics of running a small business permanently. DMC IA builds AI automation systems that are specifically designed for SME budgets, team sizes, and operational complexity — delivering the same automation capabilities as enterprise systems, at a price and pace that works for small business reality.",
    smb_b1t:"Admin on Autopilot", smb_b1p:"Invoicing, scheduling, email management, data entry, and reporting automated so your team focuses on revenue-generating work.",
    smb_b2t:"Customer Support 24/7", smb_b2p:"AI agents handle customer queries outside business hours — giving small businesses the responsiveness of a large company.",
    smb_b3t:"Sales Workflow Automation", smb_b3p:"Lead follow-up, proposal generation, and pipeline management automated — so nothing falls through the cracks.",
    smb_b4t:"Simple Integrations", smb_b4p:"AI connects your existing tools — email, calendar, accounting software, CRM — without requiring expensive system replacements.",
    smb_b5t:"Fast ROI", smb_b5p:"Most small business automation projects recover their investment within 2–3 months through direct time and labour savings.",
