    agent_cta1:"Get Free AI Audit", agent_cta2:"Learn More",
    agent_s1_h2:"What is an Autonomous AI Agent?",
    agent_s1_p1:"An autonomous AI agent is a software system powered by artificial intelligence that can perceive information from its environment, reason about what actions to take, make independent decisions, and execute complex multi-step tasks — all without requiring ongoing human supervision or instruction.",
    agent_s1_p2:"Unlike traditional automation that follows rigid, pre-programmed rules, an autonomous AI agent adapts dynamically. It handles exceptions, responds to changing conditions, learns from new data, and continuously works toward its defined objectives. Think of it as a highly capable digital worker that never sleeps, never makes errors from fatigue, and scales instantly.",
    agent_s1_p3:"DMC IA designs and deploys autonomous AI agents tailored to the specific workflows, tools, and operational reality of your business. Whether you need an agent that manages customer communications, processes financial data, coordinates supply chains, or handles administrative operations — we build the system and maintain it end-to-end.",
    agent_s2_h2:"Who Benefits from Autonomous AI Agents?",
    agent_s2_intro:"Autonomous AI agents deliver the highest value to organisations where:",
    agent_b1t:"SMEs & Small Businesses", agent_b1p:"Small teams with big operational demands. AI agents replace the need to hire for repetitive roles, allowing lean teams to compete at enterprise scale.",
    agent_b2t:"Ecommerce Businesses", agent_b2p:"High-volume operations with repetitive tasks: order processing, customer support, inventory management, review responses — all automatable with AI agents.",
    agent_b3t:"Professional Services", agent_b3p:"Accounting firms, legal offices, consultancies — any practice with structured, repeatable workflows like document processing, client communications, and reporting.",
    agent_b4t:"Restaurants & Hospitality", agent_b4p:"Reservation management, supplier ordering, staff scheduling, customer feedback processing, and promotional campaign execution.",
    agent_b5t:"Real Estate Agencies", agent_b5p:"Lead qualification, property listing management, viewing coordination, follow-up sequences, and market analysis reports.",
    agent_b6t:"Healthcare & Medical Offices", agent_b6p:"Appointment scheduling, patient communications, administrative workflows, and compliance documentation — handled accurately and continuously.",
    agent_s3_h2:"Business Problems Autonomous AI Agents Solve",
    agent_s3_intro:"Most SMEs lose 30–60% of productive time to tasks that follow predictable patterns but require constant human attention. Autonomous AI agents eliminate these bottlenecks:",
    agent_p1t:"Staff time on repetitive tasks", agent_p1p:"When skilled employees spend hours on data entry, email responses, or copy-paste workflows, AI agents take over those tasks completely.",
    agent_p2t:"After-hours operational gaps", agent_p2p:"Customer queries, order updates, and time-sensitive actions that occur outside business hours are handled instantly by autonomous agents.",
    agent_p3t:"Scaling without hiring", agent_p3p:"As your business grows, autonomous AI agents scale infinitely — processing 10x the volume with zero additional cost or delay.",
    agent_p4t:"Human error in routine processes", agent_p4p:"Data entry mistakes, missed follow-ups, forgotten tasks — autonomous agents execute with perfect consistency every single time.",
    agent_s4_h2:"How DMC IA Deploys Your Autonomous AI Agent",
    agent_step1t:"Discovery & Workflow Mapping", agent_step1p:"We audit your current processes, identify the highest-value automation targets, and map the complete decision logic your agent will need.",
    agent_step2t:"Agent Architecture Design", agent_step2p:"We design the agent's reasoning structure, define its tools and permissions, and plan integrations with your existing systems (CRM, email, databases, APIs).",
    agent_step3t:"Build & Integration", agent_step3p:"The agent is built, connected to your tools, and tested exhaustively across real workflow scenarios — including edge cases and exception handling.",
    agent_step4t:"Controlled Deployment", agent_step4p:"We deploy in a supervised phase where the agent runs alongside your team, allowing fine-tuning before full autonomous operation.",
    agent_step5t:"Monitoring & Optimisation", agent_step5p:"Ongoing performance monitoring, regular optimisation, and updates as your business evolves — ensuring the agent stays effective long-term.",
    agent_s5_h2:"Key Benefits of Autonomous AI Agents",
    agent_ben1t:"24/7 Operations", agent_ben1p:"Autonomous AI agents operate continuously — nights, weekends, holidays — with zero downtime or performance degradation.",
    agent_ben2t:"Instant Scalability", agent_ben2p:"Handle 10x the workload instantly without additional staffing, infrastructure costs, or onboarding time.",
    agent_ben3t:"Consistent Accuracy", agent_ben3p:"Every task executed to the same standard, every time. No fatigue, distraction, or variance in output quality.",
    agent_ben4t:"Full Auditability", agent_ben4p:"Complete logs of every action taken. Full transparency and accountability for every decision the agent makes.",
    agent_ben5t:"Rapid ROI", agent_ben5p:"Most businesses recover their investment within 3–6 months through labour cost savings and increased throughput.",
    agent_ben6t:"No Technical Overhead", agent_ben6p:"DMC IA handles all technical complexity. You define the business objectives — we build and maintain the system.",
    agent_faq_h2:"Frequently Asked Questions",
    agent_faq1q:"What is an autonomous AI agent?", agent_faq1a:"An autonomous AI agent is an AI system that perceives its environment, plans actions, makes decisions, and executes tasks independently — without requiring step-by-step human instruction. DMC IA builds agents tailored to your specific business workflows.",
    agent_faq2q:"How is an autonomous AI agent different from standard automation?", agent_faq2a:"Standard automation follows fixed rules and scripts. Autonomous AI agents adapt to new situations, handle exceptions, reason about context, and decide the best course of action — making them far more powerful for complex, variable workflows.",
    agent_faq3q:"What tasks can an autonomous AI agent handle?", agent_faq3a:"Autonomous AI agents can handle customer communications, data analysis, report generation, appointment scheduling, inventory checks, lead qualification, invoice processing, social media management, and hundreds of other business tasks.",
    agent_faq4q:"How long does it take to deploy an autonomous AI agent?", agent_faq4a:"Simple autonomous AI agents can be deployed within 1–2 weeks. More complex multi-agent systems typically take 4–8 weeks. DMC IA manages the entire build and deployment process.",
    agent_faq5q:"Is my data safe with an autonomous AI agent?", agent_faq5a:"Yes. DMC IA builds agents with strict permission boundaries. Agents only access the data and systems they need, and all operations are logged for full auditability. Your data never leaves your defined infrastructure perimeter.",
    agent_faq6q:"Can autonomous AI agents integrate with my existing tools?", agent_faq6a:"Yes. DMC IA builds agents that integrate with your CRM, ERP, email platforms, databases, APIs, and any other business tools you use. Seamless integration is a core part of every deployment.",
