    support_breadcrumb:"AI Customer Support",
    support_tag:"AI Automation Service",
    support_h1:"AI Customer Support Automation",
    support_sub:"Autonomous AI customer support agents that resolve queries, manage tickets, and escalate intelligently — 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Built for SMEs across Portugal, France and Europe.",
    support_cta1:"Get Free AI Audit", support_cta2:"Learn More",
    support_s1_h2:"What is AI Customer Support Automation?",
    support_s1_p1:"AI customer support automation deploys intelligent agents that handle customer interactions — questions, complaints, requests, and support tickets — automatically, conversationally, and at scale. These agents understand natural language, access your product or service knowledge base, take actions in your systems, and respond with accuracy and consistency that matches or exceeds your best human agents.",
    support_s1_p2:"Unlike traditional chatbots that follow rigid decision trees, DMC IA's AI support agents understand context, handle multi-step conversations, adapt to customer tone, and know when to escalate a sensitive issue to a human team member with full context preserved.",
    support_s1_p3:"The result: instant, high-quality customer support available 24/7, at a fraction of the staffing cost — with complete logs, full compliance, and consistent brand voice across every interaction.",
    support_s2_h2:"What AI Customer Support Agents Handle",
    support_b1t:"FAQ & Product Questions", support_b1p:"Instant accurate answers about products, services, pricing, policies, and procedures — drawn from your knowledge base.",
    support_b2t:"Order & Account Management", support_b2p:"Order status updates, returns, refunds, account changes, subscription management, and billing queries resolved automatically.",
    support_b3t:"Appointment Booking", support_b3p:"Customers book, reschedule, and cancel appointments directly through the AI agent — fully integrated with your calendar system.",
    support_b4t:"Complaint Resolution", support_b4p:"First-level complaint handling with empathetic responses, resolution actions, and intelligent escalation when needed.",
    support_b5t:"Lead Qualification", support_b5p:"AI agents capture visitor intent, qualify prospects, answer pre-sales questions, and route hot leads to your sales team.",
    support_b6t:"Post-Purchase Support", support_b6p:"Onboarding guidance, usage support, feedback collection, and upsell prompts delivered intelligently after purchase.",
    support_s3_h2:"Key Benefits of AI Customer Support",
    support_ben1t:"<2 Second Response Time", support_ben1p:"AI agents respond instantly, any time of day. No wait queues, no hold music, no business hours.",
    support_ben2t:"Multilingual Support", support_ben2p:"Serve customers in Portuguese, French, English, and more — ideal for DMC IA's European client base.",
    support_ben3t:"Unlimited Capacity", support_ben3p:"Handle 10 or 10,000 simultaneous conversations with no degradation in quality or response time.",
    support_ben4t:"Smart Escalation", support_ben4p:"AI recognises when human support is needed and hands off seamlessly with full conversation context.",
    support_ben5t:"Brand Consistency", support_ben5p:"Every response reflects your brand voice, policies, and standards — perfectly consistent across all interactions.",
    support_ben6t:"Complete Analytics", support_ben6p:"Full visibility into support volume, resolution rates, satisfaction scores, and common issue trends.",
    support_faq_h2:"Frequently Asked Questions",
    support_faq1q:"What can an AI customer support agent do?", support_faq1a:"AI customer support agents can answer FAQs, process returns and refunds, update order status, schedule appointments, resolve account issues, collect feedback, and escalate complex cases to human agents.",
    support_faq2q:"Will AI customer support feel impersonal to my customers?", support_faq2a:"No. Modern AI support agents are conversational, empathetic, and on-brand. They are tuned to match your brand tone and customer communication style precisely.",
    support_faq3q:"What languages can AI customer support agents speak?", support_faq3a:"DMC IA builds multilingual AI support agents covering Portuguese, French, English, and other languages — ideal for businesses serving customers across Portugal, France, Belgium, and Switzerland.",
    support_faq4q:"How does AI customer support handle complex or sensitive issues?", support_faq4a:"AI agents recognise when human intervention is needed and escalate seamlessly with full context — so the handoff feels natural and no information is lost.",
    support_faq5q:"Can AI customer support integrate with my helpdesk?", support_faq5a:"Yes. DMC IA integrates AI support agents with Zendesk, Freshdesk, Intercom, HubSpot, and custom ticketing systems.",
    support_faq6q:"How much does AI customer support reduce response times?", support_faq6a:"AI customer support agents respond in under 2 seconds, 24/7. Average first-response time drops from hours to milliseconds, dramatically improving customer satisfaction.",
