    /* SERVICE PAGE — AI MARKETING AUTOMATION */
    mktg_breadcrumb:"AI Marketing Automation",
    mktg_tag:"AI Automation Service",
    mktg_h1:"AI Marketing Automation",
    mktg_sub:"Run personalised marketing campaigns on autopilot. AI that creates content, times outreach, analyses performance, and optimises results — continuously and automatically.",
    mktg_cta1:"Get Free AI Audit", mktg_cta2:"Learn More",
    mktg_s1_h2:"What is AI Marketing Automation?",
    mktg_s1_p1:"AI marketing automation uses artificial intelligence to plan, execute, and continuously optimise your marketing activities without manual effort at each step. Instead of manually writing emails, scheduling posts, segmenting audiences, and analysing results, AI agents handle these tasks automatically — and do so at a level of personalisation and speed that humans simply cannot match.",
    mktg_s1_p2:"DMC IA builds AI marketing automation systems that integrate with your existing marketing tools and business data. These systems understand your customer segments, generate on-brand content, deliver it at the optimal moment, and adjust based on real performance data — creating a self-optimising marketing engine for your business.",
    mktg_s2_h2:"What AI Marketing Automation Handles",
    mktg_b1t:"Email Campaign Automation", mktg_b1p:"Triggered sequences, personalised newsletters, re-engagement campaigns, and transactional emails — created and sent automatically.",
    mktg_b2t:"Social Media Scheduling", mktg_b2p:"AI generates posts, selects optimal timing, manages publishing across platforms, and monitors engagement automatically.",
    mktg_b3t:"Customer Segmentation", mktg_b3p:"AI continuously analyses behaviour and purchase data to create dynamic audience segments for precise targeting.",
    mktg_b4t:"Lead Nurturing", mktg_b4p:"Personalised content sequences that guide prospects through the funnel based on their behaviour and engagement signals.",
    mktg_b5t:"Performance Analytics", mktg_b5p:"Automated reporting on campaign performance, attribution, and ROI — with AI-generated insights and optimisation recommendations.",
    mktg_b6t:"Ad Campaign Management", mktg_b6p:"AI monitors and adjusts paid advertising campaigns — bidding, targeting, and creative rotation — to maximise ROI continuously.",
    mktg_faq_h2:"Frequently Asked Questions",
    mktg_faq1q:"What is AI marketing automation?", mktg_faq1a:"AI marketing automation uses artificial intelligence to plan, execute, and optimise marketing campaigns automatically — personalising content, timing outreach, analysing results, and adjusting strategies without manual effort.",
    mktg_faq2q:"Can AI write marketing content automatically?", mktg_faq2a:"Yes. AI generates email campaigns, social media posts, ad copy, and product descriptions at scale — maintaining brand voice while adapting to audience segments and performance data.",
    mktg_faq3q:"How does AI personalise marketing at scale?", mktg_faq3a:"AI analyses customer behaviour, purchase history, and engagement data to deliver personalised messages and offers to each individual — automatically and in real time.",
    mktg_faq4q:"Can AI marketing automation improve my conversion rates?", mktg_faq4a:"Yes. AI-powered personalisation and timing optimisation typically increase conversion rates by 20–50% compared to manual or basic automated campaigns.",
    mktg_faq5q:"Which marketing channels can AI automate?", mktg_faq5a:"Email, SMS, social media, paid advertising, push notifications, WhatsApp, and website personalisation can all be automated and coordinated by AI marketing systems.",
    mktg_faq6q:"Does AI marketing automation work for small businesses?", mktg_faq6a:"Absolutely. DMC IA builds AI marketing automation scaled for SMEs — delivering enterprise-level marketing sophistication at a fraction of the cost.",
